    "message": "Run an operator-entered water outage on the shared generated Scenario\n\nThe run test built its own Scenario with InitialScenarioBuilder (12\nevacuees, half a day, seed 7). It now passes the same operational\nconditions to generated_scenario_with and moves to\ntests/integration/test_water_outage_conditions.py (#88).\n\nThe test of how a repeating outage expands into linked scheduled events\nchecks the generator itself, so it keeps building the draft directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
